OL,3,ABinance says fake job interviews used
OL,4,Aas part of $6.3bn crypto hack
OL,5,
OL,6,FHackers who stole a record $6.3bn
OL,7,F(#4.7bn) from Binance used fake job
OL,8,Finterviews and a compromised internal
OL,9,FAI tool, the firm has revealed.
OL,11,FInitial findings published by the
OL,12,Fcompany, which operates the world's
OL,13,Flargest cryptocurrency exchange, said
OL,14,Fhackers gained access to its systems
OL,15,Fthrough "sophisticated, multi-stage
OL,16,Fcampaign".
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,107,105,200,160,0,100
PN,11904
SC,0004
CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1793728094
OL,1,W5j 5Q#7!wsj#%uzj#57kj  7kjc1uz
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,ABinance says fake job interviews used
OL,4,Aas part of $6.3bn crypto hack
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt said they used a range of techniques
OL,7,Fsuch as malicious software downloads to
OL,8,Fcompromise the computers of Binance
OL,9,Fengineers and gain control over tools
OL,10,Fto drain its wallet of billions of
OL,11,Fdollars worth of crypto.
OL,13,FBinance called it a "serious and highly
OL,14,Fsophisticated security incident" and
OL,15,Fapologised, saying "this should not
OL,16,Fhave happened".
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
